WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.540
Every new data center needs power.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.940
Someone decides where it comes from,
who pays, and when.

3
00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:20.010
Those decisions happen on your state's grid,
mostly out of sight.

4
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.250
GridTilt is the public record.
